.SH NAME
fi_strerror \- display libfabric error strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
fi_strerror FI_ERROR_CODE
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Display the error string for the given numeric \f[CR]FI_ERROR_CODE\f[R].
\f[CR]FI_ERROR_CODE\f[R] may be a hexadecimal, octal, or decimal
constant.
Although the \f[CR]fi_strerror\f[R](3) library function only accepts
positive error values, for convenience this utility accepts both
positive and negative error values.
.PP
This is primarily a convenience tool for developers.
